.env*

# iCloud sync-conflict copies. This directory is inside iCloud Drive, which
# resolves a conflict by writing "name 2.ext" beside the original. Twenty of
# them had been committed — a stale copy of every content file, still holding
# copy we had changed days earlier, and they poisoned every grep of this repo.
# Nothing imports them and Next does not route "page 2.tsx", so they are
# invisible until you search for a string and find the wrong one.
#
# Both forms: iCloud duplicates DIRECTORIES too ("components/interactive 2/"),
# and a pattern that only matched "name 2.ext" let those through. Next also
# compiles "app/shops 2/" as a route, which is what hung the dev server.
*\ [2-9]
*\ [2-9].*

# Local tooling for scripts/brand/generate-lockup.py
.venv-brand/
